Package: dtatools
Title: Read and Write Stata Files with Stata's Missing Values
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Description: Reads and writes Stata .dta files through the dta-parser
    library, keeping Stata's extended missing values, value labels and
    comparison rules.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyselect,
    vctrs
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    haven,
    readstata13,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/testthat/edition: 3
